{"2778300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Memory Of Courage -勇气的记忆-", "steam_appid": 2778300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "《Memory Of Courage -勇气的记忆-》将通过九位不同职业角色的冒险故事，讲述一个关于勇气与记忆的故事。每个角色的冒险故事都有单独的主题，以及符合该职业对应的玩法。在某些重要的选择甚至会影响该冒险故事的走向和结局。无论你选择哪个职业开始，最终他们都将会汇聚在一起，共同拯救即将崩溃的世界！<br><br><br>进入游戏后，会有开始职业角色选择，每个职业都有不同的属性倾向，以及故事主题。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778300/extras/11a65056e6b310199d3e6de06772ae29.poster.avif?t=1706993129\" width=558 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778300/extras/11a65056e6b310199d3e6de06772ae29.webm?t=1706993129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778300/extras/11a65056e6b310199d3e6de06772ae29.mp4?t=1706993129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>除了角色扮演游戏最基础的回合制战斗外，还有对应职业的谜题需要你来挑战。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778300/extras/89598c95d1c12db37ecdd58e5f270c3d.poster.avif?t=1706993129\" width=558 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778300/extras/89598c95d1c12db37ecdd58e5f270c3d.webm?t=1706993129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778300/extras/89598c95d1c12db37ecdd58e5f270c3d.mp4?t=1706993129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778300/extras/3c7227c157ddf3fc69d44185fa1f7dd6.poster.avif?t=1706993129\" width=558 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it